  "How strongly unrevealed content smears around the reveal edge in CSS pixels.": "未显现内容在显现边缘周围的拖抹强度，单位为 CSS 像素。",
  "How strongly dust specks stand out from the background (0 to 1).": "尘埃颗粒与背景区分的强度（0 至 1）。",
  "Contrast against the background above which a pixel counts as UI and dissolves into dust. Pixels close to the background color are left untouched.": "像素与背景的对比度超过此阈值时，视为界面并溶解为尘埃；接近背景色的像素保持原样。",
