  "Sideways arc in CSS pixels particles take while flying home.": "粒子飞回原位时的侧向弧线幅度，单位为 CSS 像素。",
  "Per-particle randomness of reassembly timing (0 to 1).": "各粒子重新聚合时序的随机程度（0 至 1）。",
  "Opacity of fully scattered particles (0 to 1).": "完全散开粒子的透明度（0 至 1）。",
  "Seconds a row of dust takes to condense into the page once the reveal reaches it.": "显现抵达后，一行尘埃凝聚为页面所需的秒数。",
